  "description": "For riders who go further, carry more, and take the trail less traveled, the Drifter Adventure is built to handle it all. With clearance for 52mm tires (or 45mm with a front derailleur), it’s designed for comfort and confidence on everything from backroad rambles to rugged singletrack.\n\nThe 2025 Drifter Adventure features a new 3D-printed titanium yoke for improved tire and chainring clearance, and updated geometry with longer reach and chainstays for added stability when loaded. It’s built around our No. 6 Adventure fork, offering the strength and poise needed for technical terrain and heavy gear.\n\nAmple mounting points come standard—including triple bottle mounts, bento mounts, fork mounts, and rear rack and fender mounts—making it easy to outfit for bikepacking or big day rides. Like all No. 22 models, the Drifter Adventure is built to order in our New York facility and can be tailored to your fit and gear preferences.\n\nFULLY BUTTED TUBE SET TO SHAVE GRAMS AND TUNE RIDE QUALITY\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEAD TUBES AND HEADSETS FOR PRECISE HANDLING AND A SEAMLESS LOOK\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEADSETS COMPLETE WITH ENDURO STAINLESS BEARINGS ARE STANDARD ON ALL FRAMESETS.\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM SEAT TUBE COLLARS ARE STANDARD ON ALL FRAMESETS\n\nUDH 3D SINTERED GRADE 5 SEAMLESS TITANIUM DROPOUTS\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT NO. 6 COMPOSITES CARBON FORK INCREASES TIRE CLEARANCE WHILE MAINTAINING PERFORMANCE ORIENTED GEOMETRY\n\nT47 BOTTOM BRACKET FOR MAXIMUM STIFFNESS AND A TIME-TESTED THREADED INTERFACE\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED BRAKE BRIDGE WITH OPTIONAL CONCEALED FENDER MOUNT\n\nMULTIPLE CAGE MOUNT LOCATIONS\n\nA FULL ARRAY OF NO. 22 | PROTOTIPO WORKS BESPOKE HARDWARE\n\nGENEROUS TIRE AND CHAINRING CLEARANCE",
